# Write a page

The pages of this section have a `group` in their front matter: the menu shows the groups
as sub-headings, which can be collapsed.

## Code

A code block gets a Copy button:

```python
def greet(name):
    return f'Hello, {name}'
```

## Tables

| Setting | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `title` | title of the page |
| `section` | section of the menu |
| `group` | group inside the section |
